# Cortana Living Audio - Core Project Rules

## Project Architecture
Main entry points: [main.ts](mdc:main.ts) → [src/index.ts](mdc:src/index.ts)
Primary component: [src/core/app/GdmLiveAudio.tsx](mdc:src/core/app/GdmLiveAudio.tsx)
3D Visuals: [src/visuals/components/Visual3D.tsx](mdc:src/visuals/components/Visual3D.tsx)
Project Context: [.plan/PROJECT_CONTEXT.md](mdc:.plan/PROJECT_CONTEXT.md) - Complete project overview

## Critical Constraints
- **Real-Time Performance**: Audio latency <1000ms total, enhancement overhead <300ms
- **Universal Accessibility**: Clear, warm communication suitable for diverse users
- **Audio Priority**: Never compromise existing audio streaming functionality
- **Simplicity First**: Prefer elegant solutions, avoid external databases in Phase 1

